---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <article class="hero-content">
      <span class="overline">Diseñamos el futuro</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Arquitectura con <span class="accent">alma</span> y propósito</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Creamos espacios que trascienden lo funcional para convertirse en experiencias emocionales.
        Más de una década diseñando proyectos que conectan personas con su entorno.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/proyectos" class="btn btn-primary">Ver proyectos</a>
        <a href="/contacto" class="btn btn-outline">Contáctanos</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.85),
      rgba(22, 33, 62, 0.75)
    ),
    url("/images/hero.jpeg");
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-size: cover;
    min-height: 60dvh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: auto;
    padding: 100px 40px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .overline {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Inter Variable', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display Variable', serif;
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .accent {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    max-width: 550px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Inter Variable', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-light);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-white);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-white);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
